- pdf-lib 1.17.1 (MIT): Create and edit PDFs (merge, split, rotate, fill forms, images to PDF)
- @pdf-lib/standard-fonts 1.0.0 (MIT): Standard PDF fonts, used by pdf-lib
- @pdf-lib/upng 1.0.1 (MIT): PNG decoding, used by pdf-lib
- pako 1.0.11 ((MIT AND Zlib)): Compression, used by pdf-lib
- tslib 2.8.1 (0BSD): TypeScript runtime helpers, used by pdf-lib
- papaparse 5.7.0 (MIT): CSV parsing
- diff 9.0.0 (BSD-3-Clause): Text comparison
- qrcode-generator 2.0.4 (MIT): QR codes
- @jspawn/ghostscript-wasm 0.0.2 (AGPL-3.0): Ghostscript compiled to WebAssembly (PDF compression); shipped as dist/gs.cjs and dist/gs.wasm

